{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y部分感受词过于技术化或替人物作了更强的心理判断，例如“变成F小调”“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，不如X自然、含蓄。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事中的关键转折加亮，又让感受随着音乐进程分批出现，观众更容易在听音乐时抓住发生了什么、人物当下是什么状态。反复出现的“自己人”、受过的气、孤单和继续向前，把人物的矛盾、回忆、动摇到最终选择串成了连续的心理过程；感受也有更丰富的音乐变化、身体反应和情绪层次。X的优势是部分心理表达更含蓄自然，但左右分列的感受词需要观众自行与叙事配对，整体理解不如Y顺畅。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8def19a7-ebfc-4dc9-a2ce-1cde0d02c26b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231243265502Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:13:59.749116+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "650c4b8c0de661202294b6d756d3693ee607af357763de9d7bec400acc4451ae", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web